      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay [zone=1059]\n**Who:**\n- Karth Punox [ _Heroic Adventures_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Adventure\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:03:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Orb of Rot [item=124482]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Jerill the Enraged [npc=50775]\n- Rusank [npc=50803]\n- a chest - Decay Decreased [npc=50802]\n- an otherworldly spirit [npc=50804]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 3 01:05:01 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | This Heroic Adventure starts by saying \"can handle\" to Karth Punox in Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay\nZone in to Crypt of Decay\nTask Steps:\nYou have to equip Orb Of Rot to get updates.\nFind out what Jerill needs you to do. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nTalk to Jerill the Enraged.\nSeek places where Decay may be weak. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nThrone at ZONE IN.\nLook into the mirror. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nThis is where you right click you Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul.\nFind a place where the globe is weaker. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nFrom zone in, go to left side (south) \"intestine area\" end of tunnel.\n**Task Locks Here**\nLook into the mirror. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nAgain, right click your Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul.\nKeep searching. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nThrone inside deadbone chapel, from zoneline just go straight (west) chapel is 3-4 rooms past the brown falls.\nLook into the mirror. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nRight click Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul again.\nDefeat the otherworldly spirit. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nKill whatever just spawned.\nKeep searching. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nClick Throne a ZONE IN to get into the basement, task will update.\nLook into the mirror. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nRight click Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul.\nDefeat the wisp. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nThe Wisp that just spawned, kill it.\nReturn the Orb of Decay to Jerill and tell him what you have learned. 0/1 (Ruins of Lxanvom)\nOpen the chest 0/1\nYou can only click the mirror in the exact spot of the update. It spawns on the person who gets the proximity update NOT the person who clicks the mirror.\nThere are a couple guards on the way to update spot 3 that see through both IVU and INV guarding a doorway. The whole place is mixed see inviable and see invisible to the undead\nReward(s):\nExperience\n262pp,5gp\n583 Remnants of Tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Fayman",
