      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Who:**\n- Mayor Salvador West [ _Mayor and Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 75\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:03:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Eternity [item=124596]\n- Fractured Mirror Fragment [item=124598]\n- Select Verses of Sul [item=124737]\n- Torn Page [item=124565]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Crypt of Sul [zone=1060]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- an avatar of Tranquility [npc=50506]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Faith in Relife [quest=8064]\n- Into the Temple (A) (Quellious' Request) [quest=8049]\n- Seal of Approval [quest=8080]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 5 13:15:00 2015\nModified: Fri Jan 10 06:25:24 2025 | | Prerequisite - In order to request this group task you need to complete:\n1\\. Into the Temple [quest=8049]\n2\\. Seal of Approval [quest=8080]\nKeyword to request task is \"allow\"\nClick the skull on table in Mayor's building to access Crypt of Sul, select adventure on the screen which comes up.\nOnce in zone, fight north. You will need to use the large room later to clear mobs. Mobs can be single pulled, snared, and slowed.\nLooks like the ground spawn text will spawn anywhere around the temple and on it.\n\n---\n\n3. Locate and read religious text to find out about the religion of Anashti Sul (Select Verses of Sul) 0/1\n\n\n\nKill mobs, loot and then read the scroll for update.\n\n4. Locate and read religious text to find out about the religion of Anashti Sul (Eternity) 0/1\n\n\n\nKill mobs, loot and then read the scroll for update.\n\n5. Locate and read religious text to find out about the religion of Anashti Sul (Torn Page) 0/1\n\n\n\nGround spawn in far north room behind the temple. Read for update.\n\n6. Defeat the Bokon that are preventing you from leaving. 0/10\n\n\n\n10 Bokon spawn around where you zoned in. Not all are up at once, as you kill them more will spawn. Kill them for update.\n\n\n\n\n**On the 10th Bokon kill, the task locks.**\n\n7. Loot 1 Fractured Mirror Fragment 0/1.\n\n\n\nLast Bokon you kill will have the fragment. Loot for update.\n\n8. Give the Select Verses of Sul, Eternity, Torn Page, and Fractured Mirror Fragment to the Avatar of Tranquility (spawns where you zoned in).\n\n\n\nTurn in all these items for update and task completion. On completion of this task, Faith in Relife [quest=8064] unlocks.\n\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nYou gain experience!!\n337 platinum\n1237 Remnants of Tranquility\nMirror Fragment of Anashti Sul\nChocolate Skullberry\n**Submitted by:** Fayman\n- Chocolate Skullberries [item=124558]\n- Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul [item=124485]\n- Remnant of Tranquility [item=124218]",
