      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Who:**\n- Bokon Karass [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 360\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 03:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Mortician's Shovel [item=124678]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Lapa the Caged [npc=56561]\n- Lapa the Escaped [npc=50311]\n- a merchant [npc=50283]\n- a respected mortician [npc=50282]\n- a respectful curator [npc=50281]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 3 00:58:01 2015\nModified: Mon Oct 6 01:59:36 2025 | | Bokon Karass can be found at /way -210,-12, -420. From the zone in, head down for all the stairs, so far you can go. In the bottom, cross the small bridge and klick on the statue. This opens an entrance. Follow the small path down, into that room. Then take the winding path that leads from the room (not the corridor!) to get down to Bokon Karass. He is on the find tool CTRL F.\nKeyword to request is \"not too busy\"\nYou say, 'Hail, Bokon Karass'\nBokon Karass says, 'Ah, I remember you. You are a faithless fool, but a useful one. Perhaps you can assist the Bokon with a [problem], probably cause by one of your people.'\nYou say, 'problem'\nBokon Karass says, 'There is someone or something killing citizens. While our exceptional mayor is looking into this, I expect no results. The Bokon are busy in the Crypt with their duties, which is why the mayor should be handling this. But I would like to get answers, and so I am speaking with you. Assuming you are [not too busy].'\nYou say, 'not too busy'\nBokon Karass says, 'The Goddess brings small miracles to the faithful, it seems. Good. Then find out who is killing citizens and how they are preventing even the most faithful from transitioning. This unacceptable and must be stopped.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Deaths of the Unliving'.\n\n---\n\nThe Bokon called Karass has asked you to look into the deaths of some of the citizens of Sul Vius. These deaths have been of the permanent sort and the victims cannot transition, regardless of their faith. This is about as unpleasant as it gets for the bokon.\nThere are a few that tend the crypts. They see a lot and often go unnoticed.\n1\\. Speak with the caretakers of the sacred crypts and see if they have any further information 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nHead to the graveyard area, same as last quest, furthest south on the main level. Hail to a \"respectful curator\". /loc -585, -210, 3 or speak to a superintendent or A devoted keeper.\n2\\. Dig up one of the bodies and examine it 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nGo to the fresh graves, furthest south in this area and stand on a grave for update.\n3\\. You will need a shovel 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nKill a respected mortician (they are holding a shovel). /loc -940, -50. Everyone in group get 1 on their cursor. DO NOT destroy your shovel, it's needed later in task!\n4\\. Dig up one of the graves 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nStand on a grave and click the shovel for update.\n5\\. Examine the body 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nClick on the skeleton in the grave to update the task.\n6\\. Find the killer 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nHead down the central pit, 2 levels down (stay on your left, get to the green area on your map) Go in the building and go left. you are heading back to the area on the map with the long hallway with 12 rooms off it (still in green area). The NPC you are looking for is Lapa the Caged in one of the side rooms. Mine was in the next to the last room on the left. Hail him for update. /loc -540, 5, -120.\n7\\. See if you can find the merchant that Lapa was talking about 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nHead to the southeast area on the main level and kill merchants for updates. Be careful, \"a citizen\" in this area (actually, all throughout the zone) see through all invisibility.\n8\\. You couldn't find anything on any merchants. Go and speak with Lapa again 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nGo back down to hail Lapa again. When you get down there, he is, of course, gone. MAKE SURE you click on his cage to receive clues as to his new whereabouts AND take note he will now be, Lapa the Escaped.\nLapa can be on the platform outside the building on the same level (green).\nHe can also be in the Underground Bar area.\nHail Lapa and be prepared to kill him. I had to kill one wandering mob before I hailed.\n9\\. Defeat Lapa 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nKill him for update.\n10\\. Tell Bokon Karass what you have learned 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nHail Bokon for update\n11\\. Oh, and give Bokon Karass that shovel you, um, borrowed 0/1 Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life\nTurn in 1 shovel to complete the task. On completion, this unlocks A Feather in the Wind [quest=8068].\nXP, 225 platinum, 500 Remnants of tranquility\n\n---\n\nEverquest TBM Demiplane of Life Mercenary - Deaths of the Unliving - YouTube\nTap to unmute\nEverquest TBM Demiplane of Life Mercenary - Deaths of the Unliving Road Trips\nRoad Trips456 subscribers\nWatch on\n**Submitted by:** Hakir, Veludeus\n- Remnant of Tranquility [item=124218]",
