      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay [zone=1059]\n**Who:**\n- Mayor Soltiman Wex [ _Mayor and Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:03:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Record of Deeds [item=127751]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 3 00:50:19 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | 6 hour task timer, 3 hour lockout. This task is given by Mayor Soltiman Wex'.\nYou say, 'Hail, Mayor Soltiman Wex'\nMayor Soltiman Wex coughs, clearing his throat, 'Welcome to Sul Vius, our humble home, newcomer. I know what you're thinking, Wood Elf. \"How's a [handsome and cunning] rat like myself keep the [city from descending into chaos]?\" It's simple really.'\nMayor Soltiman Wex thinks for a moment, then interjects. '... or are you here on some sort of [heroic adventure]?'\nYou say, 'Handsome and cunning'\nMayor Soltiman Wex nods, 'With respect. That's right, Wood Elf. And that respect is [built on a foundation] of mutual understanding.'\nYou say, 'Built on a foundation'\nMayor Soltiman Wex uses a sharp claw to pick at his protruding front teeth, thoughtfully, 'As a newcomer, you should [gain an understanding] of our inhabitants. Or [ignore me] and be ignorant. It's no skin off my nose either way.'\nYou say, 'gain an understanding'\nMayor Soltiman Wex nods, 'Splendid. Head down to the tunnels connected to the central pit and pay your respects to the artifacts of the honored ancestors. Keep in mind that I cannot guarantee your safety, as some of our inhabitants are a bit... inhospitable to outsiders... or, shall we say, bloodthirsty. I trust you'll be able to defend yourself.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Paying One's Respects'.\n\n---\n\nTask Progression\n05. Visit the Three 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay) \\- /loc -259, -261, -191\n\n\n\n\nClick scroll in front of the glass.\n\n06. Visit the Marker of Doubt 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay) \\- /loc -159, -247, -191\n\n\n\n\nClick scroll in front of the glass.\n\n07. Visit the Marker of Loss 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay) \\- /loc -232,-240, -191\n\n\n\n\nClick scroll in front of the glass.\n\n08. Visit the Scrolls of Faith 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay) \\- /loc -153. -352. -191\n\n\n\n\nClick scroll in front of the glass.\n\n09. Visit the Vision of Eternity 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay) \\- /loc -253, -367, -191\n\n\n\n\nClick scroll in front of the glass.\n\n10. Visit the Statue of Eternity 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay) \\- /loc -134, -10, -307\n\n\n\n\nClick the statue and receive the Record of Deeds used in the next step.\n\n11. Read the Record of Deeds to waiting rotters 0/5 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\n\n\n\na waiting rotter(s) are located through out the building in the south west area. The first 5 will not attack. They are not social with the other bokon/citizens in the building who are not kos..\n\n12. Kill waiting rotters, if they attack you 0/2 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\n\n\n\nOnce you Click the Record of Deeds on 2 more while targeting them, they will both attack.\n\n13. Give the Record of Deeds to the Mayor 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\n\n\n\nReturn to the Mayor and give him the Record of Deeds.\n\n\n\n\nMayor Soltiman Wex wrinkles his nose, 'So, I understand you had to get your hands dirty. It's understandable, and while loss is tragic, those few that were slain would not have made the final transition. It is perhaps better that they were destroyed, and by an outsider. Now that you have seen the writing, in a manner of speaking, you are ready to see the [next step].'\n\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n187 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!! (2 AAs)\n417 Remnants of Tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Tarvas",
