      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay [zone=1059]\n**Who:**\n- Mayor Soltiman Wex [ _Mayor and Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 6 Hours\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:03:00\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Chas C. Reisburg [npc=50438]\n- Christena House [npc=50440]\n- Cynthia Friesland [npc=50441]\n- Deirdre Bost [npc=50442]\n- Johannes Friesland [npc=50445]\n- Oscar Little Doc [npc=50450]\n- Sarah Mann [npc=50453]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 3 00:51:07 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | 6 hour task timer. 3 hour lockout. This task is the second task given Mayor Soltiman Wex.\nTo get this task say 'next step'.\nShort version:\nTask Progression\n\\*Note, if you say the wrong thing to the mob (reward/punish) you will receive a buff called Feeling Foolish which last 30 seconds. You will not be able to talk to anyone until wears off.\nReward Sarah Mann 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSay reward to update step.\nReward Deirdre Bost 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSay reward to update step.\nReward Christena House 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSay reward to update step.\nReward Johannes Friesland 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSay reward to update step.\nPunish Tobias Fischer 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSay 'punish' and beat him to 10% for the update.\nPunish Oscar 'Little Doc' 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSay 'punish' and beat him to 10% for the update. a gaunt follower adds. Mez, punt, or kill prior.\nPunish Chas C. Reisburg 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSay 'punish' and beat him to 10% for the update. a gangrenous gardener will add. Mez, punt, or kill prior.\nPunish Cynthia Friesland 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSay 'punish' and beat her to 10% for the update.\nReturn to Mayor Soltiman Wex 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nHail update.\nReward:\n150 platinum\nYou gain experience!! (1 AA)\n333 Remnants of Tranquility\n\n---\n\nLong version:\nYou say, 'next step'\nMayor Soltiman Wex says 'There are rewards to be delivered to Anashti Sul's faithful and punishments to be delivered to those who have failed to follow her path. To better understand Sul Vius and its inhabitants, I'd like you to administer the next round of rewards and punishments.'\nMayor Soltiman Wex explained that there are rewards to be delivered to Anashti Shil's faithful and punishments tot be delivered to those who have failed to follow her path. To better understand Sul Vius and its inhabitants, he has tasked you with administersing these rewards and punishments.\nTell Sarah Mann, Deirdre Bost, Christena House, and Johannes Friesland that they will be rewarded for their adherence to Anashti Sul's tenets. Tell Tobias Fischer, Oscar 'Little Doc', Chas C. Reisburg, and Cynthia Friesland that they will be punished and administer this punishment yourself.\nTask Progression\n\\*Note, if you say the wrong thing to the mob (reward/punish) you will receive a buff called Feeling Foolish which last 30 seconds. You will not be able to talk to anyone until wears off.\nReward Sarah Mann 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSara Mann is located at -541, 510, -.07 in the building in the SW area, main floor SE side of building.\nSay reward to update step.\nYou say, 'Hail, Sarah Mann'.\nSarah Mann turns to face you, 'Ah, yes. I knew you would come. Have you come to [reward] or to [punish] me?'\nYou say, 'reward'\nSarah Mann muses, 'I used to worship Rodcet Nife, but now that I have perspective on his ascendance, I can recognize him as a false god, the usurper, as a fake and fragile imitation of the true goddess, Anashti Sul. She loves us in ways that he never could. He will not show himself, even in his own plane, for fear of being revealed as the fraud that he is.'\nReward Deirdre Bost 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nDeirdre Bost at location -261, 698, 63 same building as Sara. Go upstairs and outside to the bridge.\nSay reward to update step.\nYou say, 'Hail, Deirdre Bost'.\nDeirdre Bost turns to face you, 'Ah, yes. I knew you would come. Have you come to [reward] or to [punish] me?'\nYou say, 'reward'.\nDeirdre Bost muses, 'Every day, I visit the crypts. I weep in sadness for those who have failed to make the transitions. I kneel in reverence of those who lived good, honest lives. Our ancestors, those who have come before us, can teach us about ourselves... if we are only willing to listen.'\nReward Christena House 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nChristena House at 153, 731, 16 in building in the west area, main floor 2nd room in the long hallway with 6 rooms.\nSay reward to update step.\nYou say, 'Hail, Christena House'\nChristena House turns to face you, 'Ah, yes. I knew you would come. Have you come to [reward] or to [punish] me?'\nYou say, 'reward'\nChristena House muses, 'There was a time when I was vain, a time when I worshiped at the altar of the mirror. There was a time when I derived endless satisfaction from flaunting my beauty and lording it over those who were less fortunate. No more. That was a burden that I have shed. I have given up selfishness in order to be a better servant of the goddess Anashti Sul and through this sacrifice I have found salvation.'\nReward Johannes Friesland 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nJohannes Friesland is located at 24,-128, -25 by a fountain between the Mayor's building and the ramp down to the central pit, left side if you are going from the Mayor's building to the pit.\nSay reward to update step.\nPunish Tobias Fischer 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nTobias Fischer is located 137, 577, 14 same building as Christena House. NE room, main floor.\nSay 'punish' and beat him to 10% for the update.\nPunish Oscar 'Little Doc' 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nOscar 'Little Doc' is located at 194, -121, -4 same building as Mayor, far SE room.\nSay 'punish' and beat him to 10% for the update. a gaunt follower adds. Mez, punt, or kill prior.\nYou say, 'Hail, Oscar Little Doc'\nOscar Little Doc turns to face you, 'Ah, yes. I knew you would come. Have you come to [reward] or to [punish] me?'\nYou say, 'Punish'\nOscar Little Doc admits, 'Yes, I have been selfish, but with an altruistic end purpose. Helping myself helps me to help others. Nothing you say will change my mind. Do as you must!'\nPunish Chas C. Reisburg 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nChas C. Reisburg is located at 373, -46, -6 same building as Mayor, on the back porch by the entrance to Crypt of Decay\nSay 'punish' and beat him to 10% for the update. a gangrenous gardener will add. Mez, punt, or kill prior.\nYou say, 'Hail, Chas C. Reisburg'\nChas C. Reisburg turns to face you, 'Ah, yes. I knew you would come. Have you come to [reward] or to [punish] me?'\nYou say, 'punish'\nChas C. Reisburg admits, 'It's not that I don't think that Rodcet Nife is infallible, but I do feel that we need to recognize his contributions to mankind. He clearly wants to help us too, and he goes about this in his own way. Do as you must!'\nPunish Cynthia Friesland 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nCynthia Friesland same location as Johannes Friesland.\nSay 'punish' and beat her to 10% for the update.\nYou say, 'Hail, Cynthia Friesland'\nCynthia Friesland turns to face you, 'Ah, yes. I knew you would come. Have you come to [reward] or to [punish] me?'\nYou say, 'Punish'\nCynthia Friesland admits, 'I will never make the transitions. I am not a true believer and never will be. But, I cannot leave him, so we will remain in this limbo state forever. Do as you must!'\nReturn to Mayor Soltiman Wex 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nHail update.\nYou say, 'Hail, Mayor Soltiman Wex'\nMayor Soltiman Wex crinkles his nose, 'And that's how we do things here in Sul Vius. It's tough, but fair. Those you rewarded are well on their way to the final transition, and I'd wager that those you punished will never receive Anashti Sul's gifts. But as you're about to find out, it's not always so [black and white].'\nReward:\n150 platinum\nYou gain experience!! (1 AA)\n333 Remnants of Tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Tarvas",
