      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay [zone=1059]\n**Who:**\n- Mayor Soltiman Wex [ _Mayor and Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 3 Hours\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:01:00\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 3 00:52:15 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Task is correctly named \"No Reverence for the Fallen.\"\n6 hour timer, 3 hour lockout. This a shared task that is the fourth task given Mayor Soltiman Wex.\nTo get the task say, 'personal favor'\nShort version\nTask Progression\nKill adventurers 0/4 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nKill adventurers and observe how the Bokon handle their bodies.\nReturn to Mayor Soltiman Wex 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nHail update.\nKill the Bokon 0/8 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nPunish several Bokon.\nSpeak to Bokon Stuppa 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSpeak to Bokon Stuppa.\nReward(s):\n187 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!! (2 AA)\n417 Remnants of Tranquility\n\n---\n\nLong version\nYou say, 'personal favor'\nMayor Soltiman Wex leans in and speaks quietly, 'I have my suspicions that the Bokon are not committed to their tasks. Rumors have reached me that they are not handling the newly dead with the proper reverence. I want you to kill a few wandering adventurers and then see how the Bokon deal with the body. See if the bodies are given to the temple as they should be and if the Bokon treat them with dignity.'\nMayor Soltiman Wex has asked you to undertake a task as a personal favor. He is concerned about rumors that the Bokon are not handling the newly dead with the proper reverence. In order to this theory, he needs an outsider to kill another outsider to see how the Bokon handle the body.\nTask Progression\nKill adventurers 0/4 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nKill adventurers and observe how the Bokon handle their bodies.\nReturn to Mayor Soltiman Wex 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nHail update.\nYou say, 'Hail, Mayor Soltiman Wex'\nMayor Soltiman Wex clenches his fist so tightly that his dirty claws penetrate his palms, 'What?! How dare they! In my city, there are RULES! It's time to teach the Bokon a lesson in respect, my friend. If they can't treat the corpses with respect, they will become corpses. You know what to do, Tarvas. And when you're done, tell Bokon Stuppa that he's next if he can't keep his people in line.'\nKill the Bokon 0/8 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nPunish several Bokon.\nSpeak to Bokon Stuppa 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nSpeak to Bokon Stuppa.\nYou say, 'Hail, Bokon Stuppa'\nBokon Stuppa holds his palms open as an expression of peace, 'Whoah, whoah, friend. No need for violence. Your message is received and heard. My Bokon brethren and sisters will be more careful with how we handle the dead in the future.'\nBokon Stuppa is genuinely fearful and apologetic after seeing you slay many of his fellow Bokon for failing to treat newly dead bodies with the proper dignity.\nReward(s):\n187 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!! (2 AA)\n417 Remnants of Tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Tarvas",
