      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Who:**\n- Mayor Salvador West [ _Mayor and Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 03:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Water of Eternity [item=128344]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Into the Temple (B) [quest=8081]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 3 00:56:33 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | The High Bokon is a bit difficult to find. In the lowest area of the zone, deeper than the pit, there is on the side a small cave entrance which leads another step deeper. Under this area is the High Bokon on the side. INVU is your friend and you don't need to kill the roamer in the cave tunnel. Entrance to that lower area is possible via the mayors house. There is an underground tunnel which leads to the very bottom of the underground area.\nKeyword to request is \"shrines\"\n\n---\n\nAll 5 of these are on the green level of the map, 3 platforms down into the central pit. Keep left to get to the correct platform. On the 3rd platform, go into the building and take a right. the 3 rooms right in that area have signs which need to be clicked to update. Of course, there are mobs in the room so either send in a rogue or have invis and ivu on.\n1\\. Visit the Three.\nYou can find this sign at /waypoint -260, -265, -191\n2\\. Visit the Marker of Doubt.\n/waypoint -165, -250, -191\n3\\. Visit the Marker of Loss.\n/waypoint -215, -250, -191\n4\\. Visit the Scrolls of Faith.\n/waypoint -150, -365, -191\n5\\. Visit the Vision of Eternity.\n/waypoint -265, -365, -191\n6\\. Visit the Statue of Eternity.\nBottom of the pit, click on the statue get update and get water of eternity.\n/waypoint -200, 5, -308\n7\\. Show your understanding by bringing the water of eternity to a citizen in need.\nOn the main level, head south to the graveyard (furthest spot on your map), this is an invis to undead area. /waypoint -935, - 20, -10. Clear a few mobs near the fresh graves and click the water while standing on the grave. 3 mobs spawn when you click.\n8\\. Return the unhappy citizens to their graves.\nKill them for update.\n9\\. Speak to the Mayor.\nHail for update.\n10\\. Explain yourself to the Bokon Karass.\nGo to the very bottom of the pit, click on statue to go even lower and then when in that room, look for opening in wall to get to the lowest level. Bokon Karass is a quest NPC at /waypoint -208, -8, -422. task completed. On quest completion, unlocks Crypt Crimes [quest=8065].\n\n---\n\nXP 150 plat and 300 or so remnants of tranquility\n\n---\n\nVideo Guide\nEverquest TBM Mercenary Demiplane of Life - Faith in Relife - YouTube\nTap to unmute\nEverquest TBM Mercenary Demiplane of Life - Faith in Relife Road Trips\nRoad Trips456 subscribers\nWatch on\n**Submitted by:** Fayman, Hakir, Veludeus",
    },
