      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Who:**\n- Mayor Salvador West [ _Mayor and Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 03:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- The Skull of Evay Smit [item=124230]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bokon Karass [ _Quests_]\n- Evay Smit [npc=50262]\n- a corpse ravager [npc=56560]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Dec 3 00:57:37 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Talk to Mayor Salvador West in Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life to obtain this task. He is located at /waypoint -40, -210 outside and inside the central building near zone in, third room on the right. He does roam..\nKeyword to request is \"find\"\n\n---\n\n1\\. Speak with folks in the central circle, they are the most likely to encounter visitors.\nHail NPCs in the area where you zone in to get update. NPCs will tell you where next to look\n2\\. Find the visitor call Evay Smit.\nEvay Smit's can be found at /waypoint -690, 295, -13 .Looking up Evay's beastiary entry is helpful, running up to corpse will spawn 3 mobs. They do not see thru double invis.\n3\\. Kill the ravagers before they destroy the body.\nKill 3 mobs which spawned for update. Once they are dead someone in group will get a skull on their cursor.\n4\\. Deliver the Skull of Evay Smit to Mayor Salvator West.\nGive Evay's skull to the Mayor, he gives it back to everyone.\n5\\. Deliver 1 The Skull of Evay Smith to Bokon Karass.\nBokon is at bottom of central pit, just like last 2 task. Deliver just 1 skull, this completes the task. On completion, this unlocks Deaths of the Unliving [quest=8067].\n\n---\n\nXP\n150 platinum\n333 remnants of tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Hakir, Veludeus",
