      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Who:**\n- Bokon Karass [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 03:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Peacock's Feather [item=125361]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Kerath Punox [npc=50259]\n- a dangerous thief [npc=50818]\n- an admired citizen [npc=50273]\n- an intrepid thief [npc=50831]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n**Appropriate Races:**\nEntered: Thu Dec 3 00:58:29 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Hail Bokon Karass use keyword assistance\nThis will assign you the group task A feather in the wind.\nTask Steps\n- Speak with merchants of Sul Vius, they may have heard about the feather 0/1\n\n- Find and talk to the new comber described by the merchant 0/1\n\n- Force Kerath Punox to tell you what he knows 0/1\n\n- Talk to citizens in the city center, see if they know anything about thieves 0/1\n\n- Seek out thieves in the city area called the Heights in the north east 0/1\n\n- Follow the clue you found 0/1\n\n- Beat up the thief 0/1\n\n- And the minions 0/2\n\n- Looks like the thieves had the feather, get it 0/1\n\n- Give the feather to Bokon Karass. Or you couldâ€¦ 0/1\n\n\n---\n\n(Opt) Quiz Bokon Karass about the peacock feather, if you arenâ€™t too concerned how he might respond 0/1\nHail Bokon and say 'feather'\nBokon Karass says 'This is not something I can discuss with you. Hopefully you will be satisfied knowing it is one of the keys to our religion and ceremonies. The peacock is sacred to our goddess, and some of their feathers are especially blessed, such as the one you seek.'\nYour task 'A Feather in the Wind' has been updated\n(Opt) Talk to Tarl and let him know that the thieves are dead and probably out of the business of selling stolen goods 0/1\n(Opt) Or you could sell the feather to Kerath, regardless of how the Bokon might react 0/1\nHand the feather to kerath\nKerath Punox says ' Interesting. I do not wish to know where you found this, but I will reluctantly reward you for its recovery. I may know someone that can put this to use. I don't suppose you know what this is? It is a key to the crypts below this city. Yes, I most certainly do know someone that can find a use for this. Thank you.\nYour task 'A Feather in the Wind' has been updated\nYour shared task 'A Feather in the Wind', has ended\n\n---\n\nHead to the merchant area. During the early day the merchants are in there booths. The afternoons they retire to their houses.\nIt has been noted that the optional parts can cause you to fail (need verification).\n\\-\\-\\---------\nA more developed write-up of the quest as provided by Hakir:\nKeyword to request is \"assistance\"\n02. Speak to the merchants of Sul Vius, they may have heard about the feather.\n\n\n\nHead to the main level. Say \"feather\" to a merchant around the central pit. You can be invisible and get update. You may have to talk to more than 1 merchant. Merchants are in their place from 7am to 12 noon.\n\n03. Find and talk to the newcomer described by the merchant.\n\n\n\nHail Kerath Punox, the Heroic Adventures NPC, in the eastern zone on the main level, just as you go into that area.\n\n04. Force Kerath Punox to tell you what she knows.\n\n\n\nAttack Kerath Punox and fight her to 30%. Move away from her once task update or you might get aggro, especially if you used dots and they are still on her after task updates.\n\n05. Talk to the citizens in the city center, see if they know anything about thieves.\n\n\n\nHail \"an admired citizen\" for task update. It is on main level, around the central pit.\n\n06. Seek out these thieves in the city area called the Heights in the north east.\n\n\n\nHead into the eastern area, follow the path/road all the way to the very end of this area. Go behind the building at the very end of the path for task update. /loc 300, -260.\n\n07. Follow the clue you found.\n\n\n\nUse your find button and get a yellow path or a red x on your map for an intrepid thief. Mine was behind the main building on main level, furthest north on the map (I had to use my map and had the red X). I got to close to the thief, he aggroed and spawned his 2 adds. You might just be able to attack him and progress to the next step or you may have to hail him.\n\n08. Beat up the thief.\n\n\n\nHe has an AE corruption which is mean. Loot the feather which is on him\n\n09. And the minions.\n\n\n\nHave to kill his 2 minions.\n\n10. Looks like the thieves had the feather, get it.\n\n\n\nLoot feather from the intrepid thief.\n\n11. Give the feather to Bokon Karass. Or you could...\n\nI gave it to Bokon. All I have read says that if you do anything else, you fail the task. If you try it (hail Bokon, sell it to Kerath or talk to Tarl, good luck and let us know how it went :)\nXP, 300 platinum, 667 remnants of tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Hakir, Veludeus",
    },
