      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Who:**\n- Kerath Punox [npc=50259]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 6 Hours\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:03:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Lesser Health Spirit [item=124796]\n- Marching Orders of Decay [item=124658]\n- Spoiled Whip [item=125071]\n- Vial of Healing Salve [item=125070]\n- Whistle of Summoning [item=124270]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Plane of Health: In Defense of Health [zone=1068]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Lashun Novashine - Plane of Health - 2 [npc=50583]\n- a ballista [npc=57379]\n- a bubonian commander [npc=50552]\n- a leprous commander [npc=50560]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 5 13:15:51 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | This quest is obtained from Kerath Punox in Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life.\nIt seems that there may be up to six different versions of this task -and seem to be related to progression for requesting heroic adventures in Crypt of Sul.\nThe assignments vary, but boil down to:\n1) Kill commanders, destroy ballistas\n2) Kill mobs, destroy weapon crates, kill more mobs\n3) Kill mobs, kill commanders\n4) Kill mobs, kill couriers, kill more mobs\n5) Kill mobs, kill ballistas, kill commanders (listed above)\n6) Kill mobs, destroy weapon racks\nOne note about the tasks involving killing inanimate objects (weapon crates, ballista, weapon racks, etc): The mobs guarding any one of these objects seem to be aggro-linked. They can be snared, haven't checked for root.\nYou say, 'Hail, Kerath Punox'\nKerath Punox says 'Ah, yes. My brother has spoken of you, Tarvas. I'm sure he told you what our business is, so I won't bother you with that. All I want to know is whether you are interested in some [private] work, you and a few friends. Or are you one of those folks that prefers a [larger endeavor]?'\nYou say, 'private'\nKerath Punox says 'It is good to see you again, Tarvas. We appreciate that you have taken up the [job] [opportunities] we have found [for you]. Things appear to be coming to a head, and your assistance is desired once again. My contact, it seems, was impressed with your skills and, in their desperation, has asked for you specifically. This offers both of us a [chance] to earn a bit more than usual.'\nYou say, 'job'\nKerath Punox says 'A good choice. I am uncertain exactly what it is that they are in need of. There will be a list of some sort available to you once you arrive. I know that is very little information, but it seems that my contacts only want you to know what they desire. For some reason they do not trust me. Under that condition, are you [still interested]?'\nYou say, 'still interested'\nKerath Punox says 'Well chosen. You know the way to the Plane of Health, I'm sure. Be warned, things have changed some since you last passed that way.'\nZone in by zoning into Plane of Heath from either Sul or PoT.\n\n---\n\nObjective Instructions:\nStep #1\n2. Fight your way through the invaders 0/8 (The Plane of Health)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: Fight your way through the invaders from Decay.\n\n\n\n\nSeveral groups of invaders are right to the east of the zone in.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nStep #2\n\n3. Destroy the ballistas being used against the Plane of Health 0/5 (The Plane of Health)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: Destroy the ballistas in the area.\n\n\n\n\nFight your way to the north west, ballista's are clustered around the zone in hut to Sul Vius. Everything sees invis and IVU. Each ballista has two to three mobs around it. The ballista themselves are immune to spells. There are six all together.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nStep #3\n\n4. Kill the commanders directing the attack upon the Plane of Health (0/5) (The Plane of Health)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: Head through the gateway, and kill the commanders in the area who are leading the attack.\n\n\n\n\nThere is one commander and two adds. They are not linked and can be mezzed. No need to kill them to get the updates.\n\n\n\n\nTasks locks after the completion of the that step. The name or PH (a bubonian wartail) spawns along with the collectibles.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nStep #4\n\n5. Speak to Lashun Novashine 0/1 (The Plane of Health)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: Speak to Lashun Novashine within the outpost.\n\n\n\n\nHail him to get the update. He says nothing. Located at north western gate (/loc 2231, -954).\n\n\n\n\n\n\nStep #5\n\n6. Open the chest 0/1 (The Plane of Health)\n\nThat step ends the task. You get a pop up for the Lesser Health Spirit collectible. In the chest was a Greater Essence of Life and a Strifetorn Faceguard.\n\n---\n\nNEXT VERSION\nSay: still interested to request the task from Kerath Punox\nTASK SUMMARY\nStep #1\n02. Speak to Lashun Novashine.\n\n\n\n\n\nStep #2\n\n03. Kill enemy invaders from the Plane of Decay 0/8 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\n\\- Kill update.\n\n04. Kill invaders from the Plane of Decay 0/8 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\n\\- Kill update.\n\n05. Destroy the enemy's supplies 0/6 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\n\\- Kill update.\n\n06. Destroy the ballistas being used against the Plane of Health 0/5 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\n\\- Kill update.\n\n07. Kill the puslings attempting to infect the Plane of Health 0/12 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\n\\- Kill update.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nStep 3\n\n08. Loot infectious weapons from the dead invaders from the Plane of Decay 0/6 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\n\\- Loot 6 â€Spoiled Whipâ€ from the mobs you killed\n\n09. Kill the skirmishers advancing upon your position 0/5 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\n\\- Kill update.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nStep 4\n\n10. Crush the Plane of Decays commanders (0/5)\n\n\n\n\\- Kill update.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nStep 5\n\n11. Deliver 6 Spoiled Whip to Lashun Novashine (0/6)\n\n========================================================================\nSTEP #5\n========================================================================\nNAMED MOBS\n\"Bilemonger\" (or its PH, \"???\")\n\n---\n\nABOVE TASKS IN DETAIL\n========================================================================\nTRIGGERING THE TASK\n========================================================================\nYou say, 'Hail, Kerath Punox'\nPunox says 'Ah, yes. My brother has spoken of you, â€¦.. I'm sure he told you what our business is, so I won't bother you with that. All I want to know is whether you are interested in some [private] work, you and a few friends. Or are you one of those folks that prefers a [larger endeavor]?'\nYou say, 'private'\nKerath Punox says 'Ah, you again. I appreciate your help with that other [job]. It seems that a bit of a war is breaking out. When that happens there is always a small bit of profit to be made in hooking up the right parties with those that need them. You are just such a party. If a fight doesn't scare you, then I may have something [for you] to do.'\nYou say, 'job'\nKerath Punox says 'A good choice. I am uncertain exactly what it is that they are in need of. There will be a list of some sort available to you once you arrive. I know that is very little information, but it seems that my contacts only want you to know what they desire. For some reason they do not trust me. Under that condition, are you [still interested]?'\nYou say, 'still interested'\nKerath Punox says 'Well chosen. You know the way to the Plane of Health, I'm sure. Be warned, things have changed some since you last passed that way.'\nYou have received a request timer for 'In Defense of Health': 0d:0h:5m remaining.\nYou have been assigned the task 'In Defense of Health'.\n========================================================================\nZone in\n========================================================================\nClick on normal zone in to Plane of Health and pick â€adventureâ€\nYou can end up zoning in on in the centre of the zone or in the outskirts of it, depending on what steps thatâ€™s included in the adventure.\n========================================================================\nSTEP #1\n========================================================================\n02. Speak to Lashun Novashine.\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: Speak to Lashun Novashine to get more details on where your help is needed\n\n\n\n\nLashun can be on different spots depending on what steps you get. In one, he is to the right when you zone in â€\" otherwise use â€Findâ€.\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Hail Lashun Novashine.\n\n\n\n\nLashun Novashine says 'Thanks Rodcet you're here! We're under attack from the Plane of Decay. Any help you can provide is most appreciated! Here take this, It will call in a squad of Winged Defenders to your side should you find yourself in need of assistance.'\n\n\n\n\nYou recieve a Whistle of Summoning\n\n\n\n\nSpeak to Lashun Novashine.\n\n\n\n\nLashun Novashine says 'We're being invaded by the armies of Decay. Any help you can lend to push them back is greatly appreciated. Show them no mercy!'\n\n\n========================================================================\n\n\nSTEP #2\n\n\n========================================================================\n\n03. Kill enemy invaders from the Plane of Decay 0/8 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: ?\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Kill invaders, they are to the left when you zone in. Some can be snared, some not.\n\n04. Kill invaders from the Plane of Decay 0/8 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: Head outside the gate to the East and engage the invaders from the Plane of Decay. Kill as many as you can!\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Kill invaders.\n\n05. Destroy the enemy's supplies 0/6 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: ?\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Down the path, in the valley, you find 6 chest guarded by 2-3 mobs each. Note: you donâ€™t have to kill the mobs, just destroy the supplies.\n\n06. Destroy the ballistas being used against the Plane of Health 0/5 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: ?\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Destroy 5 ballistas\n\n07. Kill the puslings attempting to infect the Plane of Health 0/12 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: The puslings are attacking Plane of Health, trying to infect everything with their filth. Head down the hill and push them back. More invaders from Plane of Decay are advancing from the northwest. Destroy them!\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Kill corrupted/foul/tainted puslings\n\n\n\n\n\n\n**TASK LOCKS HERE**\n\n========================================================================\n\n\nSTEP #3\n\n\n========================================================================\n\n08. Loot infectious weapons from the dead invaders from the Plane of Decay (0/6)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says:?\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Loot Spoiled Whips from the invaders.\n\n09. Kill the invading minions of Decay 0/8 (Plane of Health)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: Huge decaying Brutes have entered the Plane of Health. Use the whistle Lashun gave you to call in a squad of Winged Defenders to help you fight them off.\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Kill â€a virulent bruteâ€ west of the center.\n\n\n\n\nWhen clicking the whistle on the wrong mob:\n\n\n\n\nThe whistle makes no sound. Perhaps you should use it only when really needed?\n\n\n\n\nWhen used on a virulent brute, you get 2 winged defenders to help tank/dos\n\n\n\n\n\\- Virulent brutes have lots of hp\n\n\n\\- Quest seems bugged, as whistle works on brutes (but not on other mobs), but the kills does not update the quest.\n\n\n\n\n\\- A shining strider and a fragment of life assists brutes.\n\n10. Intercept attack orders being delivered to the front lines by courier 0/4 Plane of Health\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: With the leaders from the assault staying back from the front lines, they pass their attack orders to the invaders via courier. Intercept the couriers and take the orders they possess. They probably wonâ€™t just hand them to you. Take them by any means necessary.\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Kill 4 Bubonian Courier. Theyâ€™re up to the NE. Watch out for mobs on the sides of the valley, and you can single pull the couriers just fine.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n========================================================================\n\n\nSTEP #4\n\n\n========================================================================\n\n11. Crush the Plane of Decays commanders (0/5)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: ?\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Further down to the left, thereâ€™s like a circle of mobs. Some of them are Commanders, kill those.\n\n12. Thin the ranks of the invaders from the Plane of Decay 0/10 Plane of Health\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: There are still a great number of invaders here. Help thin the ranks and send a message to Plane of Decay that theyâ€™re not welcome here. Kill as many as possible!\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Kill invaders. (Any mob with â€invaderâ€ in its name seems to do, as well as â€commandersâ€.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n========================================================================\n\n\nSTEP #5\n\n\n========================================================================\n\n13. Deliver 6 Spoiled Whip to Lashun Novashine (0/6)\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: ?\n\n\n\n\nReturn to Lashun with the weapons you collected\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step:\n\n\nReturn to Lashun next to where you zoned in and give Lashun the 6 Spoiled Whips.\n\n\n\n\nLashun Novashine says 'Thank you. Hopefully taking these from the enemy will reduce their effectiveness and the harm they do.'\n\n\n\n\nYour task 'In Defense of Health' has been updated.\n\n14. Deliver the marching orders to Sara Eggers\n\n\n\nTask Window Says: Deliver the marching orders youâ€™ve collected to Sara Eggers at the NORTH gate into the outer ring.\n\n\n\n\nIf You Get This Step: Give 4 Marching Orders of Decay to Sara Eggers.\n\n\n\n\nSara Eggers says 'Outstanding work! With these marching orders, we can intercept and defend against their attacks much more easily!'\n\n\n\n\n\n\n========================================================================\n\n\nSTEP #6\n\n\n========================================================================\n\n15. Open the chest\n\nUse â€Findâ€ on map to find the chest, it may be far away, depending of your adventure!\nYour task 'In Defense of Health' has been updated.\nYou have received a replay timer for 'In Defense of Health': â€¦â€¦ m remaining.\nThe denizens of the Plane of Health are a little safer because of your efforts. They now have a chance to push back the invaders.\nTASK REWARDS\n\\- Lesser Health Spirit (collectible flag, you need to click 6 of these )\n\\- Partisan of the Plane of Health\nOption 1;\nExperience, approx 2% of the experience required to go from level 105 to 106\n4 AA points\nOption 2\nGlyph of Glowing Experience\nMinor Essence of Life\nStrifetorn Faceguard\nStrifetorn Strap\n\n---\n\nNEXT VERSION\nUpon clicking into the Adventure, you enter Plane of Health at the center.\n1. Step 1 - Speak to Lashun Novashine 0/1\n\n\n\nNotes: Located next to where you ported into.\n\n\n\n\nUpon speaking with Lashun, you receive a Whistle you will use for Step 4.\n\n\n\n\nSet a Campfire up here to just pop back for turn in and chest loot.\n\n2. Step 2 - Kill the puslings attempting to infect the Plane of Health 0/6\n\n\n\nNotes: Just outside of the center gazebo\n\n3. Step 3 - Kill the invading minions of Decay 0/4\n\n\n\nNotes: Outer ring of Health zone, I went NW and found a number of them there.\n\n4. Step 4 - Summon Winged Defenders of Health to assist with Virulent Brutes 0/4\n\n\n\nNotes: Due West from center just inside from the outer ring. Huge Aggro range. Have All the players click their whistles for each Brute as the Winged Defenders do a Ton of DPS and the Brutes have almost 30 Million HPs. for each person that clicks their whistle it will add about 50k DPS or so.\n\n5. Step 5 - Return the whistle to Lashun Novashine 0/1\n\n\n\nNotes: Only need to return 1 whistle.\n\n6. Step 6 - Open the chest 0/1\n\n---\n\nNEXT VERSION\nYou have been assigned the task 'In Defense of Health'.\n(zone to PoH, choose Adventure)\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered The Plane of Health.\n1. Speak to Lashun Novashine\n\n\n\nYou say, 'Hail, Lashun Novashine'\n\n\n\n\nLashun Novashine says 'The forces of Decay are threatening to overrun the outpost and gain a foothold here. The gate overseers have been wounded and need help. Head to the outpost west of here and see if you can help them. I think you'll find this potion helpful in that regard.'\n\n\n\n\nYou have been given: Vial of Healing Salve [item=125070]\n\n\n\n(each toon in the task get one, 5 charges each)\n\n2. Rescue injured overseers 0/4\n\n\n\nKill bubonians, pestilent and leprous mobs in groups of 1-3 around each of 4 injured overseers. The mobs are tightly linked: pull one of the group and they all come, seemingly regardless of distance. Mezzable, snareable. Root didn't seem to hold.\n\n\n\n\nWhen mobs at each overseer are dead, target overseer and click Vial of Healing Salve\n\n\n\n\nWhen you heal the fourth injured overseer your task will update.\n\n\n\n\n**TASK LOCKS HERE**\n\n3. Destroy the invaders' weapons 0/5\n\n\n\nThere are six widely spaced weapons racks near the zone to Plane of Life. Each is guarded by 1-3 mobs, tightly linked. Kill the mobs or kite them away and destroy the weapon racks.\n\n\n\n\nWhen the fifth weapon rack is destroyed your task updates.\n\n4. Return the vial to Lashun Novashine\n\n\n\nGive him any one toon's vial.\n\n\n\n\nLashun Novashine says 'Thank you. We may have need of this in the future.'\n\n5. Open the chest\n\n\n\nYou have received a replay timer for 'In Defense of Health': 0d:1h:18m remaining.\n\n\nThe denizens of the Plane of Health are a little safer because of your efforts. They now have a chance to push back the invaders.\n\n\nYou receive 300 platinum .\n\n\nYou gain experience!!\n\n\nYou receive alternate currency.\n**Submitted by:** Fayman, Tarvas\n- Broadsword of the Stranger [item=124208]\n- Buckler of Shimmering Light [item=124488]\n- Cudgel of the Stranger [item=124608]\n- Lesser Health Spirit [item=124796]\n- Oscillating Stone [item=124652]\n- Pauldrons of the Dark Side [item=124530]\n- Peacock's Cloak [item=124613]\n- Severed Hooplet [item=124612]\n- Shadowthorn [item=124489]",
