      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Who:**\n- Kerath Punox [npc=50259]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Loot\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:03:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Corrupted Tissue [item=56875]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bhaly Adan [npc=50534]\n- Darwol's Bounty [npc=50681]\n- Totem of Decay [npc=50550]\n- a leprous invoker [npc=50880]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Bane of Decay: Challenge of Toughness (10 Points) [quest=9614]\n- Hero of The Plane of Health [quest=8194]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 5 13:16:36 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Hail, Kerath Punox in Demiplane of Life.\nKeyword is \"prevent a war \"\nClick on the crystal at the zone-in in Demiplane of Life which will give you option to go to your adventure. This will take you to your mission.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Speak to Lashun Novashine near the source of the infection.\n> **Task Window:** ?\nHail Lashun for task update.\n2\\. Cleanse the area of corrupted inhabitants 0/10.\n> **Task Window:** ?\nKill 10 corrupted fragments/scouts/defenders/striders in the outer ring of the zone for updates.\n3\\. Collect samples of corrupted tissue from the dead wildlife 0/6.\n> **Task Window:** ?\nThese come off the dead corrupted.\n4\\. Deliver the corrupted tissue samples to Lashun Novashine.\n> **Task Window:** ?\nDeliver the samples for update.\n5\\. Destroy the totems spreading corrupted and decay 0/6.\n> **Task Window:** ?\nKill the corrupted totems (large skulls) for updates. They are rooted to their spot and cast Corruptive Fog (62.5k single target -950 RA disease, 1200 range nuke) constantly.\n6\\. Kill Darwol Adan.\n> **Task Window:** ?\nA large named mouse spawns in the middle of the mobs. He can be snared and should since he will run at low health. His chest spawns where he spawned.\nExtra : Name Bhaly Adan can pop in this task\n7\\. Rummage through Darwol's Bounty for anything useful.\nFindable via Ctrl + F.\n> **Task Window:** ?\n8\\. Open chest to complete mission.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nXP, 150 platinum, 333 remnants of tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Fayman, Hakir, Veludeus\n- Broadsword of the Stranger [item=124208]\n- Cyclical Impetuator [item=124607]\n- Raw Crypt-Hunter's Leggings [item=124728]\n- Severed Head of Severity [item=124559]\n- Severed Spaulders [item=124631]",
