      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Who:**\n- Kerath Punox [npc=50259]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Related Zones:**\n- Plane of Health: Defenders of the Faith [zone=1074]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Kavilis Adan [npc=55583]\n- Reliquary of Decay [npc=55585]\n- Syrina Pureheart [npc=50589]\n- Xhut Adan [npc=55581]\n- a bubonian thrall [npc=55580]\n- a nauseating invader [npc=55582]\n- an infected winged defender [npc=55584]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Hero of The Plane of Health [quest=8194]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n**Appropriate Races:**\nEntered: Sat Dec 5 13:17:10 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Formerly known as \"The Final Assault\" (changed very early in expansion release).\n\n---\n\n**Task Steps**\nThis mission starts when you speak to Kerath Punox and say 'Do the Work' to her. Upon receiving the mission, you click on the crystal that leads to the Plane of Health and select 'Adventure'.\nSpeak to Syrina Pureheart 0/1 (Plane of Health)\nStop the bubonian thralls. They lead the assault. 0/12 (Plane of Health)\n**_TASK WILL LOCK HERE_**\nKill Xhut Adan 0/1 (Plane of Health)\nDestroy the slimy invaders advancing on Rodcet Nife's throne 0/16 (Plane of Health)\nKill Kavilis Adan 0/1 (Plane of Health)\n**_Ground Spawn Collections and Prepusterous [npc=50800] or its PH will spawn at this point_**\nYou must destroy those that were infected by the Adan's last breath. 0/2 (Plane of Health)\nOpen the Reliquary of Decay 0/1 (Plane of Health)\n**Reward(s):**\nYou receive 5 gold.\nYou receive 187 platinum.\nYou receive alternate currency.\n\n---\n\n**Event Summary and Strategy**\n**1.** _After you speak with Syrina Pureheart, the event will start. You are going to want to position your group outside of the central area where the bubonian thralls will be advancing. The bubonian thralls have a damage aura that will only hurt the NPCs you are attempting to defend, so keep them away from them. You are going to want to have 1 person run a circle to tag any bubonians making their way to the area you are defending and kite them to your group._\n**2.** _The task will lock after you kill the thralls and you will fight your first named NPC, Xhut Adan. He hits for an average of 25k but is fast, and strikes through defenses regularly. You are definitely going to want to have someone slow him or have a competent tank._\n**3.** _After the death of Xhut Adan, you will have 16 slimes to contend with. They come up in intervals of 2 to 3 at a time and have the same damage aura as the bubonians do. Use the same strategy as above, and have one person run a perimeter to grab any mobs that may be headed towards Syrina Pureheart. Be advised the slimes will use snare on you and could complicate the kiting strategy._\n**4.** _At this point, you will fight the second named NPC called Kavilis Adan. This NPC is no stronger or weaker than Xhut Adan; hitting for an average of 25k but is very fast and will strike through defenses regularly._\n**5.** _After defeating Kavilis Adan, you will have two winged sentry-type mobs attack you. Evidently, they were poisoned by the corruption of the Adans. They hit for an average of 25k but are not as fast as the two Adan NPCs. Defeat them both and then open the chest to win the event!_\nThe Winged defenders are not affected by the purple fog,\n\n---\n\n**Event Failure Mechanic**\n_If too many NPCs that you are suppose to defend die, the event will fail and will require a restart._\n**Submitted by:** Aghinem",
