      factions = {
      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Who:**\n- Anna Broth [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 3\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:01:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Anna Broth's Recruitment Poster [item=124196]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bokon Boles [npc=52911]\n- Lonyen Drelliad [npc=50448]\n- a fledgling zombie [npc=56563]\n- an arm muncher [npc=56562]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sat Dec 5 13:31:51 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Keyword to request is \"help\"\n1\\. Find the source of the apparition.\nLook on your map and get a good idea where you are in relation to where Anna is because you will want to come back to this spot from Demiplane of Decay at the end of your task. Stay between the wall and Anna and click your Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul [item=124485]. This will take you to Demiplane of Decay. Invis to undead and head south to the 1st cage you see and get near it. This will update your task.\n2\\. Ask Lonyen Drelliad about the zombies.\nHail Lonyen and go through his dialogue. This will spawn 3 zombie which are very easy to kill. If you don't attack them or something happens you can hail Lonyen again for 3 more. Killing them updates task.\n3\\. Ask Lonyen Drelliad about the ambush.\nGo through the dialogue with Lonyen and this will update task.\n4\\. Find the room where Lonyen last saw his friends.\nGo in the large building right next to where you just talked to Lonyen and go into the last room on the right in the long hallway with 6 rooms off of it. This is on the ground floor. This will update your task. Arm munchers do not see through invis to undead.\n5\\. Kill arm munchers.\nKill the arm munchers for the update. Get invis to undead on as soon as they are dead because they re-spawn very quickly.\n6\\. Find clues in the room.\nclick on a stack of books on a small table in the corner to update. Whoever clicks on the books will get a recruitment poster in one of their bags. SAVE IT, you need it to request the next task with Anna.\n7\\. Confront Bokon Boles in the Demplane of Life.\nWhile still in Demiplane of Decay, go upstairs to the balcony. Head back down the hall like you are leaving the building and when you leave the hallway make an immediate right and that will take you upstairs. Go out the door and straight across to the rail on the balcony and then click your Mirror Fragment. This will take you back to Demiplane of Life and Bokon will be to your west in a corner. Hail Bokon and he will attack which updates your task.\nBokon is initially non-agro.\nBokon Boles glowers at you dubiously -- looks like quite a gamble.\nYou say, 'Hail, Bokon Boles'\nBokon Boles laughs at your questions and retorts, 'I'm not experimenting on zombies, fool. I'm making them, and you're next!'\n8\\. Subdue Bokon Boles.\nDPS Bokon to 45% health (this is roughly 7 million HP of damage). Bokon is a necro, casting standard necro spells: Grip of Mori, Insidious Retrogression, Plague, Shackle Rk. III (I guess he's been raiding).\nAt 45% health Bokon goes non-agro:\nBokon Boles signals surrender and says, 'Ooh, you're good. I've love to have you as one of my undying. Don't worry, my magic can rip the stubbornness right out of you.'\nBokon Boles puts his hand in his pocket and he starts to fade. He taunts you as he disappears, 'Farewell. Meet me in my laboratory if you're interested in my offer.'\n9\\. Chase Bokon Boles into the Demiplane of Decay.\nClick your Mirror Fragment and go back to Demiplane of Decay. Head back down to the same room you were just in fighting the arm munchers. Bokon will be the that room. Enter to update the task. He does not see thru invis to undead.\n10\\. Defeat Bokon Boles.\nYou can pull him out of this room, he is not social with the arm munchers.\nOn first agro:\nBokon Boles chuckles and says, 'I'm glad you changed your mind. Embrace your undeath!'\nAt 60% Bokon summons 3 A fledgling zombie. This are snarable, very low health and low damage:\nBokon Boles says, 'I have mastered undeath! I will make all foolish adventurers like you into perfect zombies!'\nAt 35% Bokon summons 3 more:\nBokon Boles looks weakened, but shouts defiantly, 'Look what I did to that fool elf and his companions. I turned them into zombies and made them kill each other over and over and over. You will be the same!'\nUpon bokon's death:\nBokon Boles's corpse says, 'See you soon.'\nYou have slain Bokon Boles!\n11\\. Explain your discoveries to Lonyen Drelliad.\nLonyen Drelliad's eyes grow big as he hears your story about how Bokon Boles turned his friends into zombies. He looks down as his bloody weapon and up at the [cages] and the zombies he's been killing over and over. He says nothing.\nLonyen Drelliad cuts you off and shouts, 'Yes! I heard you! I know who's in those cages and it makes me want to vomit. Oh Tunare... how could I [murder them]? I didn't know...'\nLonyen Drelliad looks at you through tears and says solemnly, 'There's no excuse for a deed this dark. I've killed... my friends countless times. I can still feel the Bokon's magical grip on me, urging me to kill them again. I can't get him out of my head. There's no redemption. There is only [one thing] left to do.'\nLonyen Drelliad shoves his blade into his own gut and sputters as he falls to his knees, 'I'm sorry... friends. Tunare... take my sacrifice ... save them.'\nGo through the dialogue and this will update your task. Now go back over to the area you remember where Anna was, in Demiplane of Life. Click your Mirror fragment. If you have the right spot, you will appear in Demiplane of Life and not agro any mobs.\n12\\. Give the bad news to Anna Broth.\nYou say, 'Hail, Anna Broth'\nAnna Broth looks sick as you tell her what you've discovered about her friends' fate. She looks at you and says, 'This can't be the end. There must be something we can do to help them!'\nYou discovered the source of the apparitions. A high elf in the Demiplane of Decay is repeatedly killing zombies he doesn't realize are his adventuring friends. You destroyed the powerful Bokon who zombified the adventurers, but were unable to break the spell trapping them in their murderous cycle.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nXP, 187 platinum, 417 remnants of tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Fayman, Hakir\n- Remnant of Tranquility [item=124218]",
