pt 0/5 (Crypt of Sul)\nAny mob with fiend in their name should work.\n4\\. Deliver 3 Thickened Liquid to Pavel Raglan 0/3 (Crypt of Sul)\nThe liquid drops a ravenous fiend and a skeletal sentinel.\n5\\. Kill the Bokon within the crypt 0/5 (Crypt of Sul)\nAny mobs with Bokon in their name should work.\n6\\. Kill the reliving within the crypt and collect more Signets of Relife 0/5 (Crypt of Sul)\na relifed citizen, a risen citizen and an honored citizen drop the signets.\n7\\. Kill the Bokon within the crypt 0/5 (Crypt of Sul)\nAny mobs with Bokon in their name should work.\n8\\. Deliver 3 Caustic Elixir to Pavel Raglan 0/3 (Crypt of Sul)\na revered worshiper and a skeletal sentinel drop these.\n9\\. Kill the Skeletal Sentinels within the crypt 0/4 (Crypt of Sul)\n10\\. Collect even more Signets of Relife 0/5 (Crypt of Sul)\na relifed citizen, a risen citizen and an honored citizen drop the signets.\n11\\. Kill fiends within the crypt 0/5 (Crypt of Sul)\nAny mob with fiend in their name should work.\n12\\. Deliver 3 Extract of Mort to Pavel Raglan 0/3 (Crypt of Sul)\nThis drops off, an awakened watcher, a nascent supplicant, an awakened mystic, a bokon, a skeletal sentinel and a ravenous fiend.\n13\\. Destroy corpses within the crypt 0/5 (Crypt of Sul)\na failed corpse and a fresh corpse should update this.\n14\\. Speak with Pavel Raglan and deliver the Signets of Relife 0/15 (Crypt of Sul)\n15\\. Kill High Bokon Koraza 0/1 (Crypt of Sul)\n16\\. Return to Pavel Raglan and deliver the potion components 0/1 (Crypt of Sul)\n17\\. Open the chest 0/1 (Crypt of Sul)\n18\\. Speak with Pavel Raglan to receive your payment 0/1 (Crypt of Sul)\n19\\. Open the chest 0/1 (Crypt of Sul)\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nExperience\n187 Platinum 5 Gold\n417 Remnants of Tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Sadistic Trappings [item=128861]",
