      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Who:**\n- Grubbonion [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 130\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 01:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Cracked Sul Vius Key [item=124538]\n- Decay Spike [item=124540]\n- Healing Ward [item=124542]\n- Slimy Key Bit [item=124484]\n- Sul Vius Tower Key [item=124539]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay [zone=1059]\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Korinth the crusher [npc=50447]\n- Thiroc the redeemer [npc=50256]\n- a bokon flayer [npc=50746]\n- a bubbling pusling [npc=50369]\n- a clever bubonian [npc=50370]\n- a clumsy bubonian [npc=50371]\n- a deathfeeder [npc=50748]\n- a lost magus [npc=50747]\n- a swollen pusling [npc=50749]\n- a tsetse bilesucker [npc=50745]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Jul 27 06:25:31 2016\nModified: Sat Mar 14 09:02:57 2026 | | This a shared task given by Grubbonion [npc=50260] in Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life that is part of the mercenary achievement in Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay. It has a 6 hour timer, 3 hour lockout.\nNOTE: even though only 1 person is required to get the task, you will need at least 2 people for the final step with Thiroc the Redeemer [npc=50256].\nGrubbonion hastily writes a note, ties it to a key, and throws it down the well.\nTo get the task, hand Grubbonion the Cracked Sul Vius Key [item=124538] from Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay found on the lip of the well.\nGrubbonion looks excited when you hand him the key and exclaims, 'Ye get it! Yer jest de venter ev been lecken fer!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Grubbonion's Locked Tower'.\n\n---\n\nShort version\nTask Progression\n1\\. Talk with Grubbonion 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nYou say, 'Hail, Grubbonion'\nGrubbonion looks excitedly at the key you gave him and says, 'Ged ged ged. Des be real ged. Jed need da bet an we be set. Go get et en da derk crepts. De begs lek de shenees. Den we get rech tegether.'\nYou get the key back.\n2\\. Travel to the Demiplane of Decay 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nClick your Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul [item=124485] to zone back into Demiplane of Decay.\n3\\. Loot Slimy Key Bit 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nKill tsetsians in the crypt area and loot a Slimy Key Bit [item=124484].\nNote: to get to the crypt area, you must first zone back into Demiplane of Life and go through the opening at /way -627,-272 then back to Decay.\n4\\. Travel to the Demiplane of Life 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nClick over to Demiplane of Life and run back to Grubbonion.\n5\\. Give the restored Sul Vius Tower Key to Grubbonion 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nRight-click the Slimy Key Bit.\nYou begin casting Restore Sul Vius Key.\nThe two pieces of the Sul Vius Tower Key fuse together perfectly, and a spark of magic flies from them as they connect.\nGive the Sul Vius Tower Key [item=124539] to Grubbonion.\nYou offered 1 Sul Vius Tower Key to Grubbonion.\nGrubbonion hastily writes a note, ties it to a key, and throws it down the well.\nGrubbonion grabs the key from you and says, 'Well den, Drewie. Des well get es en det tewer sen. Et's det wen jest east ef es.'\nA bokon jailor rushes towards Grubbonion to interrogate him about some recent thefts. You see Grubbonion wink at you and throw the key down the well as he approaches.\n(Opt) Defend Grubbonion from the Bokon Flayer 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nKill the bokon flayer [npc=50746] that attacks Grubbonion.\n6\\. Escape to the Demiplane of Decay 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nClick over to Decay.\n7\\. Pick up the key Grubbonion threw into the well 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nThe key is on the ledge where the previous was. Pick it up.\nYou pick up the Sul Vius Tower Key that Grubbonion threw into the well for you.\n8\\. Find the locked tower near the well 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nFind the door to the locked tower. Location update at /way -117,-752 just east of the well.\n9\\. Try opening the door of the tower with the key 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nClick the door and zone in.\nAs you touch the key to the decaying doorknob, you're pulled through the keyhole and thrown out on the other side of the door, disoriented and slightly nauseous.\n10\\. Kill minions of decay inside the locked tower 0/8 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nKill any of the mobs inside.\n11\\. Loot Decay Spike 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nLoot Decay Spike [item=124540] from a decay minion.\n12\\. Travel to the Demiplane of Life 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nClick over inside the tower.\n13\\. Kill minions of health inside the locked tower 0/8 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nKill any of the mobs inside.\n14\\. Loot the Healing Ward 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nLoot a Healing Ward [item=124542] from a health minion.\n15\\. Travel to the Demiplane of Decay 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nTravel to Decay to find the first monster.\n16\\. Obliterate Korinth the Crusher 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nKorinth the Crusher [npc=50447] is at /way -516,-672,+72. Weaken Korinth in battle until he's vulnerable at 26%.\nKorinth the crusher stops fighting you and rushed towards a crack in the wall near where you found him.\nKorinth the crusher siphons a wisp of dark energy from a crack in the wall, and appears to grow in strength. Use a Healing Ward to smite him now before he recovers!\nUse the Healing Ward [item=124542] to smite him.\nKorinth the crusher explodes is completely overrun by healing energies. His body bursts into cleansed goo that splasts against the wall behind him.\n17\\. Travel to the Demiplane of Life 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nClick where you killed Korinth.\n18\\. Corrupt Thiroc the Redeemer 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nAttack Thiroc the Redeemer [npc=50256] till 26% and then everyone but one person click back over to Decay. One of the people who clicks back over to Decay needs to have the Decay Spike. Immediately click the Decay Spike in Decay.\n19\\. Give the Healing Ward and the Decay Spike to Grubbonion 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n112 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!! (1 AA)\n250 Remnants of Tranquility\n\n---\n\nLong version\nIn Demiplane of Life, every 4.5 minutes:\nGrubbonion hastily writes a note, ties it to a key, and throws it down the well.\n(Grubbonion mutters a random line of text.)\nIn Demiplane of Decay, meanwhile:\nA rusty key plops up from the depths of the well and lands on the ledge.\nIf you pick up the Cracked Sul Vius Key from the lip of the well in Demiplane of Decay:\nYou grab a rusty, broken key off of the well ledge. A note tied to it reads, 'If you find this key, throw it back down the well!'\nIf you right-click the key in Demiplane of Decay while standing by the well:\nYou begin casting Throw down the well.\nYou throw the Cracked Sul Vius Key down the well, like the note asked you to. Nothing seems to happen.\nMeanwhile, in Demiplane of Life:\nGrubbonion laughs as a key flies up out of the well and lands on the ledge next to him.\nIf you right-click the key in Demiplane of Decay, but are not standing near the well:\nThe attached note says to throw it down a well in Sul Vius.\nIf you right-click the key in Demiplane of Life:\nThe attached note asks you to throw this key down a well in the Demiplane of Decay.\nYou say, 'Hail, Grubbonion'\nGrubbonion eyes you up and down slowly before deciding to speak, 'Ye ged at [sheense], Wood Elf?\nYou say, 'sheense'\nGrubbonion rolls his eyes and says slowly, 'Wet er yew slew? [SHIIIEEENNNSSSSSS].\nYou say, 'SHIIIEEENNNSSSSSS'\nGrubbonion looks ready to punch you as he blurts out, 'Eh geds, yew er de dumbest Wood Elf I ever seen. Siense, lek where ye de da experements wed de. Ye knew wet em telkin bet? Sayense!\nYou say, 'science'\nGrubbonion slaps the side of his face, 'Yes! Fenly! Seense, lek I sed! Enways, ed ell be bet des [key].'\nYou say, 'key'\nGrubbonion gets a greedy look in his eyes and pulls you in close to whisper, 'Des plen net be wet et seems. Der be enether sed te et. I been threwen keys dewn dis well wed [nets teched]. Dey kep cemen beck.'\nYou say, 'notes attached'\nGrubbonion rolls his eyes again and says, 'NETS ETECHED. Meh geds, yeh be dem. Ge ta de edder sed en lek fer de key I drew.'\nSwitch over to Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay. Pick up the Cracked Sul Vius Key on the lip of the well. Zone back over to Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life and give the key to Grubbonion.\nGrubbonion looks excited when you hand him the key and exclaims, 'Ye get it! Yer jest de venter ev been lecken fer!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Grubbonion's Locked Tower'.\n(You receive the Cracked Sul Vius Key back.)\n1\\. Talk with Grubbonion 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nHail Grubbonion\n2\\. Travel to the Demiplane of Decay 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nClick over to Demiplane of Decay\n3\\. Loot Slimy Key Bit 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nKill tsetsians in the crypt area and loot a Slimy Key Bit.\n4\\. Travel to the Demiplane of Life 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nClick over to Demiplane of Life and run to Grubbonion.\n5\\. Give the restored Sul Vius Tower Key to Grubbonion 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nRight click Slimy Key Bit then give to Grubbonion.\nGrubbonion grabs the key from you and says, 'Well den, Tarvas. Des well get es en det tewer sen. Et's det wen jest east ef es.'\n(Opt) Defend Grubbonion from the Bokon Flayer 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nKill the Bokon Flayer that attacks Grubbonion.\nA bokon jailor rushes towards Grubbonion to interrogate him about some recent thefts. You see Grubbonion wink at you and throw the key down the well as he approaches.\n6\\. Escape to the Demiplane of Decay 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nClick over to Decay\n7.Pick up the key Grubbonion threw into the well 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nThe key is on the ledge where the previous was was and pick it up.\n8\\. Find the locked tower near the well 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nFind the door to the locked tower.\nLocation update at /loc -117, -736. Just east of the well.\n9\\. Try opening the door of the tower with the key 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nClick the door and zone in.\n10\\. Kill the minions of decay inside the locked tower 0/8 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nKill any of the mobs inside\n11\\. Loot Decay Spike 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nLoot from a decay minion\n12\\. Travel to the Demiplane of Life 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nClick over inside the tower.\n13\\. Kill minions of health inside the locked tower 0/8 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nKill inside the tower\n14\\. Loot the Healing Ward 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nLoot from a health minion\n15\\. Travel to the Demiplane of Decay 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nTravel to the Plane of Decay to find the first monster\n16\\. Obliterate Korinth the Crusher 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nWeaken Korinth in battle and then use the Healing Ward to smite him when he is vulnerable at 26%.\n17\\. Travel to the Demiplane of Life 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nClick where you kill Korinth. Make sure he disappears before clicking over.\n18\\. Corrupt Thiroc the Redeemer 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nAttack Thiroc the Redeemer till 26% and then everyone but one person click back over to Decay. One of the people who clicks back over to Decay needs to have the Decay Spike. Immediately click the Decay Spike in Decay. You can have a second toon parked in Decay at the same spot you kill Thiroc the White Horse .. have your toon that was beating on Thiroc stand right on top of him while the other toon in decay clicks the Spike to get the update.\n19\\. Give the Healing Ward and the Decay Spike to Grubbonion 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nTurn in both items.\nGrubbonion looks at you like your crazy and says, 'I ent teching dat! It's get ell serts a deseses!'\nGrubbonion's eyes get big as you hand him the ward and he says, 'Ye den ged, Tarvas. I'll sell des te a ged persen. Dent werry.'\nYou have reduced the power of Anashti Sul's demiplanes, and hindered her ability to expand her influence into other planes. You also helped Grubbonion make a pretty penny, but you're not yet sure if that's a good thing.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n112 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!! (1 AA)\n250 Remnants of Tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Tarvas",
    },
