      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay [zone=1059]\n**Who:**\n- Twilius Quill [ _The Lexicon Explorers_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 360\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 03:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Decaying Zombie Flesh [item=124214]\n- Essence of Undeath [item=124588]\n- Rodcet's Tear [item=124590]\n- Un-Undead-O-Matic [item=124589]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay [zone=1059]\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Filius Quill [ _The Lexicon Explorers_]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Jul 27 22:05:44 2016\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Prerequisite : you need all the previous tasks from Mercenary of Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay [quest=8157] done in order to be able to trigger this one.\nTalk with Twilius Quill 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nHail Twilius at zone in.\n\n---\n\nIf you haven't done all the required tasks to trigger :\nTwilius Quill doesn't look up from the gadget he's tinkering with and says, 'You mind getting out of my light? I'm kinda busy here.'\nYou say, 'help'\nTwilius Quill says, 'Thanks for the offer, but I think I'd better wait for someone I can trust.'\n\n---\n\notherwise :\n**What does he answer to \"hail\" and \"help\" ?**\nLoot Decaying Zombie Flesh 0/5 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nDropped off any zombie model mob in the zone.\nGive Decaying Zombie Flesh to Twilius Quill 0/5 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nHand the 5 zombie flesh to Twilius Quill back in the little tunnel at the zone in.\nGive Decaying Zombie Flesh to Filius Quill 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nRight click your Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul to go back to Demiplane of Life. Twilius gave you back 1 Zombie Flesh to give to his brother. Filius can be found using the find list.\nFind the underground museum entrance balcony 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nLocation update. About half way down the pit is normally a locked door but this time it will be open.\n/loc -90, -55, -195.\nFind the guarded section of the museum 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nLocation update (/loc -175, -370, -190). Continue East from the museum entrance into the dead end. There will be a large bokon standing guard that kicks you back (breaks invis) if you get too close. Once you get this step to update in Demiplane of Life you have to find a safe corner to right click your Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul. Once in Demiplane of Decay go into the opposite part of the previously guarded room and click your Mirror Fragment of Anashti Sul again. There will be a shadowy smoking effect on a pedestal, click it to get an Essence of Undeath in your bag.\nSteal an Essence of Undeath 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nRefer to the above paragraph\nGive Essence of Undeath to Twilius Quill 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nHead back to Twilius in Demiplane of Decay and hand him the essence.\nUse the Un-Undead-O-Matic on guktan or neglected citizens 0/5 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nRight click the Un-Undead-O-Matic in your bag on \\*undead\\* guktan or neglected citizens\nReport your findings to Twilius Quills 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nHail Twilius again.\nFind the lost artifact 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nClick on the big crystal in the pit under the waterfall. Be ready for an ambush.\nKill Wild Bokons 0/3 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nUnmezzable, 100% slowable and are snareable.\nUse Rodcet's Tear to heal a guktan 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nRodcet's Tear will be in your bag after completing the previous steps. I right clicked mine on a \"a forgotten guktan\" in the pit for the update.\nGive the artifact to Twilius Quill 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay)\nHand Twilius Rodcet's Tear. He'll give it back.\nGive the artifact to Filius Quill 0/1 (Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life)\nHand Filius Rodcet's Tear.\nReward(s)\nExperience\n112pp, 5gp\n250 Remnants of Tranquility\n**Submitted by:** Gidono, Veludeus",
